ai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/fd83c3e237d8afd4c6695702f0c2bfd9.poster.avif?t=1757475528\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/fd83c3e237d8afd4c6695702f0c2bfd9.webm?t=1757475528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/fd83c3e237d8afd4c6695702f0c2bfd9.mp4?t=1757475528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build an Unbeatable Deck</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine cards and Relics to build an unstoppable deck.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 200+ cards, create lethal combinations that are unique to you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique effect combos with 60+ equippable Relics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear runs to unlock 10 different heroes with unique abilities.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of random events make each run a new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/65dbac2d4072fa20062900f2cf68b4e7.poster.avif?t=1757475528\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/65dbac2d4072fa20062900f2cf68b4e7.webm?t=1757475528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/65dbac2d4072fa20062900f2cf68b4e7.mp4?t=1757475528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise to the Challenge in Multiple Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Adventures: With fixed and random boss fights and daily challenges, you